meta {
  name: Useful List
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/usefuls/list?page=1&limit=10
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  limit: 10
}

headers {
  Accept-Language: oz
}

script:post-response {
  if (res.getStatus() === 200 && res.body && res.body.items && res.body.items.length) {
    bru.setEnvVar("usefulId", res.body.items[0].id);
  }
}

docs {
  Admin ro'yxati, `sort_order ASC, id ASC` tartibida. limit: 1..100, standart 10.

  `files` da faqat ASOSIY rasm (`is_main: true`) qaytadi — ro'yxat miniatyurasi uchun.
  Hamma rasm kerak bo'lsa Detail so'rovidan oling.
  Birinchi elementning `id`si `usefulId` env o'zgaruvchisiga yoziladi.
}
